### Variáveis de ambiente
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1


######################################
### CLIENTES
######################################

### Listar todos os clientes
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers
Accept: application/json

###

### Buscar cliente por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Cadastrar novo cliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Diego Ferreira",
  "document": "44444444444",
  "email": "diego.ferreira@email.com"
}

###

### Cadastrar novo cliente - CPF já existente (deve retornar 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Duplicada",
  "document": "11111111111",
  "email": "ana.duplicada@email.com"
}

###

### Cadastrar novo cliente - dados inválidos (deve retornar 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "document": "123",
  "email": "email-invalido"
}


######################################
### CONTAS
######################################

### Criar conta corrente para o cliente 4 (Diego)
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 4,
  "accountType": "CHECKING",
  "initialBalance": 5000.00
}

###

### Criar conta poupança para o cliente 4 (Diego)
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 4,
  "accountType": "SAVINGS",
  "initialBalance": 2000.00
}

###

### Criar conta duplicada (deve retornar 422 - cliente já possui esse tipo de conta)
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "accountType": "CHECKING",
  "initialBalance": 1000.00
}

###

### Listar todas as contas
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Accept: application/json

###

### Buscar conta por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Buscar conta inexistente (deve retornar 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/999
Accept: application/json

###

### Listar contas de um cliente
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/customer/1
Accept: application/json


######################################
### TRANSFERÊNCIAS
######################################

### Transferência entre contas correntes (Ana → Bruno)
### Conta 1 (Ana CHECKING R$10.000) → Conta 3 (Bruno CHECKING R$8.000)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payerId": 1,
  "payeeId": 3,
  "amount": 500.00
}

###

### Transferência de poupança dentro do limite (Ana poupança → Bruno corrente)
### Conta 2 (Ana SAVINGS R$5.000) → Conta 3 (Bruno CHECKING)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payerId": 2,
  "payeeId": 3,
  "amount": 1000.00
}

###

### Transferência de poupança acima do limite por transação (deve retornar 422)
### Limite por transferência da poupança: R$ 2.000,00
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payerId": 2,
  "payeeId": 3,
  "amount": 2500.00
}

###

### Transferência com saldo insuficiente (deve retornar 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payerId": 1,
  "payeeId": 3,
  "amount": 99999.00
}

###

### Transferência para a mesma conta (deve retornar 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payerId": 1,
  "payeeId": 1,
  "amount": 100.00
}

###

### Transferência com conta inexistente (deve retornar 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payerId": 1,
  "payeeId": 999,
  "amount": 100.00
}

###

### Transferência com valor zero (deve retornar 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payerId": 1,
  "payeeId": 3,
  "amount": 0
}

###

### Buscar transferência por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/transfers/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Buscar transferência inexistente (deve retornar 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transfers/999
Accept: application/json

###

### Extrato da conta 1 (Ana - corrente)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transfers/account/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Extrato da conta 3 (Bruno - corrente)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transfers/account/3
Accept: application/json


######################################
### AUDITORIA
######################################

### Auditoria da conta 1 (Ana - corrente) — exibe SUCCESS e FAILED
GET {{baseUrl}}/transfers/audit/account/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Auditoria da conta 2 (Ana - poupança)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transfers/audit/account/2
Accept: application/json
